WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.070
Do you remember that presentation you worked hard on, when the first question came from an angle you missed?

00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:09.710
Or nobody asked anything, which is worse.

00:00:10.680 --> 00:00:15.110
Now, CEOs have a board of advisors that helps them make critical decisions.

00:00:15.620 --> 00:00:22.990
And your work deserves one too, to help you make the right calls for your customers, partners, management and peers.

00:00:23.660 --> 00:00:30.810
That's why, in this adventure, you build a board of advisors tailored to your preferences, your audience and your needs.

00:00:31.520 --> 00:00:37.510
It's a small group of AI personas that argue about your real work, saved as a skill for next time.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:39.970
So, who would you hire?

00:00:40.800 --> 00:00:41.370
Warren Buffett?

00:00:42.080 --> 00:00:42.750
Elon Musk?

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:44.030
Oprah Winfrey?

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:45.470
Mother Teresa?
